  <h2>Transport Protocols</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Streamable HTTP</strong> — POST/GET <code>/mcp</code> (2025-06-18 spec)</li>
    <li><strong>Stdio</strong> — JSON-RPC over stdin/stdout (local CLI servers)</li>
    <li><strong>SSE</strong> — Server-Sent Events for notifications</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Registry Presence</h2>
  <p>P31 MCP servers are published to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://glama.ai">Glama</a> — 21,000+ servers</li>
    <li><a href="https://smithery.ai">Smithery</a> — 7,000+ servers</li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/anthropics/official-registry">Official AAIF Registry</a> — 9,650+ servers</li>
    <li><a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/modelcontextprotocol/servers">HuggingFace</a> — 5,033+ servers</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="callout callout-info">
    <div class="callout-title">Total: 222 Tools</div>
    <p>Across 17 servers (5 edge HTTP + 12 CLI stdio), the P31 ecosystem exposes 222 tools for AI agents, covering crypto, design, care coordination, governance, and more.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="last-updated">Last updated: August 2026</div>
</DocsLayout>

